      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَظَّ الجُوَالِقَ</span></b> , (S,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الوِعَآءَ</span>, (K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَظُ3َ</span></b> ,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَظٌّ</span>, (TA,) <i>He fastened its</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِظَاظ</span> [q. v.]
<i>upon the sack:</i> (S:) or <i>he put the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِظَاظ</span> <i>into the
bag;</i> [meaning <i>into its loop,</i> or <i>handle;</i>] as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشظّهُ</span></b> : (K:) or the latter signifies <i>he put to it,</i>
or <i>made for it,</i> (namely the sack,) <i>a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِظَاظ</span>. (S.)

